# Force LF line endings on checkout regardless of core.autocrlf, so every
# `git worktree add` (healer/CI-fix fix attempts included) checks out files
# byte-identical to what `read_file`/`propose_patch` see and diff against.
# Without this, Git for Windows' system-wide core.autocrlf=true silently
# converts LF -> CRLF on checkout into a *new* worktree even though the
# main working tree and the git blobs are LF-only, which breaks `git apply`
# context matching for any diff built from `read_file`'s (LF) output.
* text=auto eol=lf
